OL,3,GNEWSAPost office closure 'diabolical',
OL,4,Aresidents warn
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a Sussex town saying the
OL,7,Floss of their local post office is
OL,8,F"diabolical" and "ridiculous", with the
OL,9,Fbranch set to be closed for about six
OL,10,Fmonths.
OL,12,FUckfield Post Office shut its doors on
OL,13,FTuesday as a result of the closure of
OL,14,Fthe TG Jones (formerly WH Smith) branch
OL,15,Fin the High Street, with alternative
OL,16,Fservices remaining in Ridgewood and
OL,17,FFive Ash Down.
OL,19,FDespite banking services moving to a
OL,20,Fnew high street banking hub, a
OL,21,Fspokesperson said a replacement hub
OL,22,Fwould take time to open.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
